r even keys that unlock secret areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/5b09db949d97b23d117fe101bfedfadb.avif?t=1750545167\" width=610 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/820c985d8b7b2fb58b5aa6c02159d4ef.poster.avif?t=1750545167\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/820c985d8b7b2fb58b5aa6c02159d4ef.webm?t=1750545167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power of the Anointed</strong>: Unleash the power of the anointed and dominate the battlefield with time on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberation and Justice</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue innocent prisoners and free the oppressed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover stolen livestock and treasures.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faith and Devotion</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy pagan idols and purify the land. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect God's altars.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating Arrow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Flurry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whirlwind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coup de Gr\u00e2ce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Judgment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Downward Strike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mass</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
